Package: libcosmic
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SoryOS Team <maintainers@soryos.local>
Depends: soryos-archive-keyring, pkgconf, cmake, libexpat1-dev, libfontconfig-dev, libfreetype-dev, libxkbcommon-dev, rust-all
Description: COSMIC GUI toolkit (Rust) — development headers
 libcosmic is the Rust GUI toolkit for the COSMIC desktop environment,
 built on a vendored fork of iced.
 .
 This development package provides the build environment for creating
 COSMIC desktop applications in Rust.
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
